WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.045
Think of a view as a contract The object name
matters The

00:00:07.071 --> 00:00:14.164
exposed columns and types matter The row grain
matters And

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:19.713
consumers should understand how fresh the data is If
you change a shared

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:24.082
view in a way that breaks one of these expectations
downstream queries can fail or

00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:24.832
change meaning
